# Frontend React

## Structure

- `pages/` — routed views (Dossiers, Dossier, Carnet, PersonView)
- `graph/` — Cytoscape engine + graphStore
- `components/` — layout, panels, modals, search
- `services/` — api.ts, websocket.ts
- `types/` — domain types shared across pages
- `stores/` — Zustand stores (investigationStore, graphStore)

## Conventions

- Functional components; Zustand for global state
- Co-located CSS with design tokens from `index.css`
- Dark Glassmorphism UI; icons via lucide-react
- i18n: add keys to `i18n/locales/en.ts` and `fr.ts`
- Avoid `any`; type Cytoscape events explicitly where possible

## Graph UX

- Default depth: 1 hop
- Use icons + shapes + labels, not color alone (accessibility)
- Focus mode: center on selected person, dim secondary nodes
- Filters: relation type, platform, confidence, node type

## Routing

```
/                          → Dossiers list
/dossier/:id               → Carnets grid
/dossier/:id/carnet/:cid   → CarnetViewPage (list / timeline / notes by notebook_type)
/dossier/:id/graph         → Legacy graph canvas (CarnetGraphPage)
/dossier/:id/person/:eid   → Person Intelligence View
```

See `docs/PROJECT_CONTEXT.md` for carnet types and when to use graph vs list vs person view.

## Provenance UI

Every entity card shows: source, collectedAt, confidence badge, status label.

AI Analysis tab only when Context Readiness Score ≥ threshold.

## Command Search

Cmd+K / Ctrl+K — global search with exact / normalized / potential match labels.
